# This directory is ~4 GB, almost all of it derived or downloaded. Only the things that
# cannot be regenerated from the scripts in this repo are tracked: the scripts themselves,
# the findings, and the measured data.

# Build outputs and third-party trees. All reproducible: hip-gfx1010/ comes from
# build-hip-gfx1010.ps1 + src/, rocmlibs/ is a released 7z, vulkan/ and rocm/ are upstream
# llama.cpp downloads, src/ is a git clone of llama.cpp b10630.
hip-gfx1010/
build-hip/
rocm/
rocmlibs/
vulkan/
src/

# Logs. build_hip.log alone is 114 MB; the PowerShell-written ones are UTF-16LE.
*.log
*.log.txt
HIPSDK_INSTALL_LOG.TXT

# Archives and scratch.
*.7z
*.tmp
*.pid

# verify/ is 560 files / 192 MB, mostly disassembled code objects and raw perf-counter
# captures from the A/B verification. Keep only the re-runnable C3 harness and its results
# -- the raw captures are large, machine-specific, and regenerable by re-running.
verify/*
!verify/c3fix/
verify/c3fix/*
!verify/c3fix/c3-fix.sh
!verify/c3fix/c3-fresh.sh
!verify/c3fix/analyze.py
!verify/c3fix/results.csv
